- **Capacity and Bandwidth:** Link budgets provide a fundamental understanding of a link's capacity (bandwidth) and inherent limitations.  They are crucial for determining if a service can be accommodated without causing congestion.  
    - High-revenue services often demand more bandwidth and capacity to ensure smooth and timely delivery of their data. 
    - Navigation safety services, while less demanding in terms of bandwidth, may require more robust links to ensure reliable operation, especially in challenging environments. 
